      "question": "What are the main features of Terraform?",
      "answer": "Terraform's main features include Infrastructure as Code (IaC), execution plans, resource graphs,\nchange automation, and state management.\nExample:\nterraform {\nbackend \"s3\" {\nbucket = \"my-terraform-state\"\nkey = \"global/s3/terraform.tfstate\"\nregion = \"us-west-2\"\n}\n}",
