      "answer": "Structured System Design & Troubleshooting Framework:<br>1. <strong>Triage & Blast Radius:</strong> Acknowledge incident, establish incident bridge, identify user impact.<br>2. <strong>Mitigation First:</strong> Execute automated rollback, enable rate limiting, or scale replicas.<br>3. <strong>Root Cause Analysis:</strong> Trace request spans across Jaeger/Datadog and analyze database lock contention.<br>4. <strong>Resolution & PIR:</strong> Confirm SLO restoration and publish blameless post-mortem with actionable preventive tasks.",
